00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:50.880
leading productive companies. And you can detect&nbsp;
the same kind of psychological variation you can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:57.200
get if you compare, you know, the groups from&nbsp;
