00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:02.000
representative populations of these countries.
Speaker 1: Can you talk a little bit about, you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:08.400
know, in the title of the book, you use the term&nbsp;
