Speaker 1: You know, some of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:36.400
the characteristics you write about in that&nbsp;
you've spoken about high level of individualism&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:43.200
may be analytical to some degree in a way that's&nbsp;
not as common in other societies or in other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:49.680
parts of society, non conformism, etc.. I will&nbsp;
often hear from people when they visit a country&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:55.680
that is outside of of this group, you know,&nbsp;
friends who have done work in Southeast Asia&nbsp;&nbsp;

