psychological differences. So when I talk about&nbsp;
analytic thinking, you know, analytic thinking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:05.120
can be very powerful, breaking things down into&nbsp;
parts and assigning them properties. It's really&nbsp;&nbsp;

