the basis of how you know what physics is, right?&nbsp;
Break everything down into particles and give them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:14.720
charges or spin or charge or something like&nbsp;
that, and then explain everything from that.&nbsp;&nbsp;

